# What this repo takes from ANTfrastructure. One row per asset: the id from
# third_party/ANTfrastructure/shared/config/shared-assets.manifest, and a path only
# when the copy does not sit at that registry row default.
#
# Checked by:
#   bash third_party/ANTfrastructure/shared/config/sync-shared-config.sh --repo-root . --check
#
# .clang-format sits in the native plugin, the only hand-written C++ here, so the
# app's generated runner sources stay outside it (2026-10-12, hub CON71).
#
# The three names NOT listed here are not overrides - nothing here runs clang-tidy
# or gcovr, and scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit is a plain git hook rather than the
# pre-commit framework, so .clang-tidy, gcovr.cfg and .pre-commit-config.yaml were
# never taken.

cmake-format
antfrastructure-sh
resolve-build-module
agentic-loop-sh
agentic-loop-ps1
clang-format packages/kataglyphis_native_inference/.clang-format
